#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:1
msgid "获取并管理金融数据"
msgstr "Acquire and manage financial data"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:3
msgid "`qteasy`是一个完全本地化部署和运行的量化交易分析工具包，具备以下功能："
msgstr ""
"`qteasy` is a fully locally deployed and run quantitative trading analysis "
"toolkit with the following features:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:5
msgid "金融数据的获取、清洗、存储以及处理、可视化、使用"
msgstr ""
"Acquisition, cleaning, storage, processing, visualization, and use of "
"financial data"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:6
msgid "量化交易策略的创建，并提供大量内置基本交易策略"
msgstr ""
"Creation of quantitative trading strategies, with a large number of built-in"
" basic trading strategies provided"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:7
msgid "向量化的高速交易策略回测及交易结果评价"
msgstr ""
"Vectorized high-speed backtesting of trading strategies and evaluation of "
"trading results"

