"advanced-vertical-timeaxis.md) / [横截面选股](2.7-historypanel-advanced-"
"horizontal-multifactor.md) / [事件型因子](2.8-historypanel-advanced-event-kline-"
"pattern.md)）→ [第一个策略回测](3-start-first-strategy.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**The position of this article in the data experience path**: [Installation "
