#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:50
msgid "获取基础数据以及价格数据"
msgstr "Obtain basic data and price data"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:52
msgid ""
"如上一篇教程介绍，刚刚初始化的`qteasy`是无法调用任何历史数据的，所有历史数据都必须首先下载到本地，保存到一个称为`Datasource`的数据仓库之后，才能完成后续所有需要数据的工作，例如调用历史数据，进行策略的回测和优化等等。"
msgstr ""
"As introduced in the previous tutorial, a newly initialized `qteasy` cannot "
"access any historical data. All historical data must first be downloaded "
"locally and saved into a data repository called `Datasource` before you can "
"carry out any subsequent data-dependent work, such as retrieving historical "
"data, backtesting and optimizing strategies, and so on."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:54
msgid ""
"`qteasy`需要使用的数据种类很多，所有的数据都是保存在一些预定义的数据表中，`Datasource`就是一系列数据表的集合。其中最基础的数据表包括："
msgstr ""
"`qteasy` needs to use many types of data. All data is stored in some "
"predefined data tables, and `Datasource` is a collection of a series of data"
" tables. The most basic data tables include:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:56
msgid "`trade_calendar` - 交易日历数据，包括不同交易所的开市、闭市日期计划，每年底更新下一年的交易日历"
msgstr ""
"`trade_calendar` - Trading calendar data, including the planned market open "
"and close dates for different exchanges; the trading calendar for the next "
"year is updated at the end of each year."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:57
msgid "`stock_basic` - 股票基础信息（文档中有时统称「basics」），包括沪深股市所有股票的基本信息"
msgstr ""
"`stock_basic` - basic stock information (sometimes collectively referred to "
"as \"basics\" in the document), including basic information for all stocks "
"in the Shanghai and Shenzhen stock markets"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:58
msgid "`index_basic` - 指数基础信息，包括沪深股市所有指数的基本信息"
msgstr ""
"`index_basic` - Index basic information, including basic information of all "
"indexes in Shanghai and Shenzhen stock markets"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:60
msgid "`refill_data_source(tables=...)` 使用**数据表名**（如 `stock_basic`），与上列一致。"
msgstr ""
"`refill_data_source(tables=...)` Use **data table name** (such as "
"`stock_basic`), consistent with the above list."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:62
msgid "在配置好`tushare_token`以后，第一次导入`qteasy`时，如果系统未找到交易日历数据，会显示信息提示交易日历无法读取。"
msgstr ""
"After configuring `tushare_token`, when you import `qteasy` for the first "
"time, if the system cannot find trading calendar data, it will display a "
"message indicating that the trading calendar cannot be read."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:64
msgid ""
"关于`DataSource`数据源对象的更多信息，请参见[DataSource Reference](../references/2-get-"
"history-data.md)"
msgstr ""
"For more information about the `DataSource` data source object, see "
"[DataSource Reference](../references/2-get-history-data.md)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:69
msgid "提示信息："
msgstr "Tip:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:74
msgid ""
"`qteasy`提供了一个函数`get_table_overview()`来显示本地存储的数据信息，运行这个函数，可以打印出本地保存的数据表的清单，存储的数据量、占用的磁盘空间大小、以及数据范围等等。"
msgstr ""
"`qteasy` provides a function `get_table_overview()` to display information "
"about locally stored data. Running this function prints a list of the data "
"tables saved locally, the amount of data stored, the disk space used, the "
"data range, and so on."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:79
msgid "数据表分析过程可能会花费几分钟时间，其间会显示进度条显示分析进度。分析完成以后，会显示本地数据源的数据表清单，以及数据表的数据范围等信息。"
msgstr ""
"The data table analysis process may take a few minutes. During this time, a "
"progress bar will be displayed to show the analysis progress. After the "
"analysis is complete, a list of tables in the local data source will be "
"shown, along with information such as the data range of each table."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:81
msgid "如果当前数据源中没有任何数据，会输出如下："
msgstr ""
"If there is no data in the current data source, the following will be "
"output:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:97
msgid "如果本地数据源中没有数据，将会显示上面的内容。此时需要下载数据到本地数据源。"
msgstr ""
"If there is no data in the local data source, the content above will be "
"displayed. In this case, you need to download data to the local data source."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:99
msgid "下载交易日历和基础数据"
msgstr "Download the trading calendar and basic data"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:101
msgid ""
"我们可以调用`refill_data_source`函数下载交易日历和基础数据。这个函数是`qteasy`的标准数据下载接口函数，所有的历史数据类型均可以通过此接口下载。这个函数的基本参数是`tables`，传入数据表的名称即可下载相应的数据到本地存储了。使用`refill_data_source`下载交易数据时，`qteasy`会自动进行数据清洗，排除重复数据，去除错误数据，发生错误自动重试，并将下载的数据合并到本地数据表中。"
msgstr ""
"We can call the `refill_data_source` function to download the trading "
"calendar and basic data. This function is the standard data download "
"interface function of `qteasy`. All historical data types can be downloaded "
"through this interface. The basic parameter of this function is `tables`. "
"Pass in the name of the data table to download the corresponding data to "
"local storage. When using `refill_data_source` to download transaction data,"
" `qteasy` will automatically clean the data, exclude duplicate data, remove "
"erroneous data, automatically retry when errors occur, and merge the "
"downloaded data into the local data table."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:103
#, python-format
msgid ""
"`qteasy`支持通过 **`tushare`、`akshare`、`eastmoney`、`sina`** 等多个内置通道下载数据（参数 "
"`channel`，未指定时默认为 "
"`tushare`）。不同通道支持的表范围与前置条件不同，切换方式与能力对照见[数据通道文档](../manage_data/10.%20data_channels.md)。"
msgstr ""
"`qteasy` supports downloading data through multiple built-in channels such "
"as **`tushare`, `akshare`, `eastmoney`, `sina`** (parameter `channel`, "
"defaults to `tushare` when not specified). Different channels support "
"different table ranges and preconditions. For a comparison of switching "
"methods and capabilities, see [Data Channel "
"Documentation](../manage_data/10.%20data_channels.md)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:105
msgid "要下载前面提到的交易日历、股票和指数的基本信息，只需要运行下面的代码（默认使用 Tushare，需已配置 `tushare_token`）："
msgstr ""
"To download the aforementioned trading calendar, basic information on stocks"
" and indices, just run the following code (using Tushare by default, "
"requires `tushare_token` configured):"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:110
msgid "数据下载过程中会显示进度条显示下载进度。"
msgstr ""
"During the data download process, a progress bar will be shown to display "
"the download progress."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:112
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:184
msgid "输出如下："
msgstr "The output is as follows:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:123
msgid "下载完成后，再次运行`qt.get_table_overview()`函数"
msgstr ""
"After the download is complete, run the `qt.get_table_overview()` function "
"again."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:128
msgid "可以看到数据已经成功下载到本地："
msgstr "You can see that the data has been successfully downloaded locally:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:145
msgid ""
"可以看到，三张数据表已经被下载到本地数据源，数据源的类型为`\"file://csv@qt_root/data/\"`类型（即数据以`csv`文件形式存储在qt根路径的`/data/`路径下），包含三张数据表，其中交易日历的范围涵盖到2024年年底。"
msgstr ""
"As you can see, the three data tables have already been downloaded to the "
"local data source. The data source type is `\"file://csv@qt_root/data/\"` "
"(i.e., the data is stored as `csv` files under the `/data/` path in the qt "
"root directory). It contains three data tables, and the trading calendar "
"range covers through the end of 2024."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:147
msgid "查看股票和指数的基础数据"
msgstr "View basic data for stocks and indices"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:149
msgid "上面的基础数据下载好之后，建议重新启动IDE，重新导入`qteasy`。这时，我们就可以使用`qteasy`筛选和查找股票/指数了。"
msgstr ""
"After downloading the basic data above, it is recommended to restart the IDE"
" and re-import `qteasy`. At this point, we can use `qteasy` to filter and "
"look up stocks/indices."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:151
msgid ""
"查找股票/指数详细信息可以使用`get_stock_info()`或者`get_basic_info()`函数，两个函数功能相同，都可以根据输入的证券代码、名称或者关键字查找证券的信息，支持通配符或者模糊查找；如果同一个代码对应不同的`qt_code`，例如股票`000001`代表平安银行，对应`qt_code:"
" 000001.SZ`，而指数`000001`代表上证指数，`qt_code: 000001.SZ`，`qteasy`会罗列出所有的证券信息："
msgstr ""
"To look up detailed stock/index information, you can use the "
"`get_stock_info()` or `get_basic_info()` function. The two functions have "
"the same functionality: both can look up security information based on the "
"input security code, name, or keywords, and support wildcards or fuzzy "
"search. If the same code corresponds to different `qt_code`s—for example, "
"stock `000001` represents Ping An Bank, with `qt_code: 000001.SZ`, while "
"index `000001` represents the SSE Composite Index, with `qt_code: "
"000001.SZ`—`qteasy` will list all security information:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:157
msgid "输出如下:"
msgstr "The output is as follows:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:171
msgid "更多的输出可以查看下图："
msgstr "More output can be seen in the figure below:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:173
msgid "![在这里插入图片描述](img/get_stock_info.png)"
msgstr "![Insert image description here](img/get_stock_info.png)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:175
msgid "在上面的例子中，系统只找到了类型为股票和指数的证券，如果还需要查找基金、期货等更多的证券信息，用同样的方法下载更多的基础数据表即可："
msgstr ""
"In the example above, the system only found securities of the stock and "
"index types. If you also need to look up more securities information such as"
" funds and futures, you can download more basic data tables in the same way:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:177
msgid "**fund_basic**: 基金基础数据"
msgstr "**fund_basic**: Basic fund data"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:178
msgid "**future_basic**: 期货基础数据"
msgstr "**future_basic**: Basic futures data"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:180
msgid "除了查找股票或证券的基本信息以外，我们还能用`qt.filter_stock()`函数来筛选股票："
msgstr ""
"In addition to looking up basic information about stocks or securities, we "
"can also use the `qt.filter_stock()` function to screen stocks:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:193
msgid "下载沪市股票数据"
msgstr "Download Shanghai-listed stock data"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:195
msgid "金融数据中最重要的数据类型非量价数据莫属。接下来，我们就来下载历史价格数据。"
msgstr ""
"Among financial data, the most important type is undoubtedly price and "
"volume data. Next, we will download historical price data."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:197
msgid "`qteasy`的历史数据全都是以K线数据的形式存储在数据表中的，目前支持的K线数据包括："
msgstr ""
"All historical data in `qteasy` is stored in data tables in the form of "
"candlestick (K-line) data. The currently supported candlestick data "
"includes:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:199
msgid "分钟K线 - 1分钟/5分钟/15分钟/30分钟/60分钟K线"
msgstr ""
"Minute candlestick charts - 1-minute/5-minute/15-minute/30-minute/60-minute "
"candlestick charts"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:200
msgid "日K线"
msgstr "Daily candlestick chart"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:201
msgid "周K线"
msgstr "Weekly candlestick chart"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:202
msgid "月K线"
msgstr "Monthly candlestick chart"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.0-get-data.md:204
msgid ""
"我们同样使用`qt.refill_data_source()`函数下载股票数据。最常用的股票日K线数据保存在`stock_daily`表中。不过由于数据量较大，我们最好在下载数据时限定数据的范围，通过`start_date`/`end_date`参数，指定下载数据的起始日期，分批下载历史数据，否则，下载的过程将会非常漫长："
msgstr ""
"We also use the `qt.refill_data_source()` function to download stock data. "
"The most commonly used daily stock candlestick (K-line) data is stored in "
"the `stock_daily` table. However, because the data volume is large, it’s "
"best to limit the data range when downloading. Use the "
"`start_date`/`end_date` parameters to specify the start and end dates, and "
"download historical data in batches; otherwise, the download process will be"
" very time-consuming:"

